'''Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1 Update|Version 15.1.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep
|image = E 767.png
|first appearance = [[Nen Nen Korori]]
|money drop = 0¢ - 0¢
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

